# Full cache subtrees (runtime data, never canonical)
cache/imbalance/
cache/live/
cache/wsh/
cache/*/.push_status_*
cache/*/.feed_status_*
cache/*/.ibkr_smoke_status_*

# Local audit/planning docs (working notes, not canonical — keep off main)
docs/audit-*.md

# Continue IDE config (machine-local, contains absolute paths)
.continue/

# Claude Code + Cursor local state (agent worktrees, settings.local.json,
# .mdc rules) — machine-local tooling, never project files.
# EXCEPTION (2026-07-12): a curated set of shared Claude Code skills + the
# truth-auditor agent ARE checked in, so every clone / agent gets them. Anything
# else under .claude/ (settings.local.json, worktrees, other local skills like
# run-terminal) stays machine-local.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/truth-audit/
!.claude/skills/verify-review-findings/
!.claude/skills/skipp-pr-flow/
!.claude/agents/
.claude/agents/*
!.claude/agents/truth-auditor.md
.cursor/

# mutmut setup.cfg (contains absolute machine paths, not portable)
setup.cfg

